A file-backed tag listing agrees with the public API after CLI name formatting.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight tags --format json

========== API ==========

tags({});

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
tag Imported
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Opening
  ; Imported: yes
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  "Imported"
]
